{"source":{"uri":"Features/Smoke/016_WC_Smoke_Test.feature","data":"@CLDC @WC @smoke_test @wc_smoke_test @cldc_smoke_test\r\n\r\nFeature: WC Smoke Test\r\n  As a Commercial Lines Duck Creek policy processing user\r\n  I want to complete the WC Smoke Test workflow\r\n  So that the business transaction is executed with source-traceable data and verification\r\n\r\nBackground: Prepare Commercial Lines Duck Creek for policy processing\r\n\tGiven I open a browser session\r\nScenario Outline: WC Smoke Test - <stateCode>\r\n\tGiven test data \"<dataFile>\" and external data \"<externalDataFile>\" are loaded\r\n\tAnd I open the configured Commercial Lines Duck Creek application\r\n\tAnd I sign in to Commercial Lines Duck Creek using configured credentials\r\n\tAnd I start a new quote\r\n\tAnd I enter business client information\r\n\tAnd I add a new Associated Client - Business Owner Type - Click Add Client\r\n\tAnd I complete the Associated Client Info\r\n\tAnd I complete required policy information\r\n\tAnd I complete WC Specific Fields\r\n\tAnd I run insurance score\r\n\tAnd I navigate to Policy Info and Verify Desc\r\n\tAnd I click on QA button to logout\r\n\tAnd I open the configured Commercial Lines Duck Creek application\r\n\tAnd I sign in to Commercial Lines Duck Creek using configured credentials\r\n\tAnd I search for the quote description using quick search\r\n\r\nExamples:\r\n\t| stateCode | dataFile                                           | stateVariant | stateName      | externalDataFile                    |\r\n\t| AL        | TestData/Scenarios/Smoke/016_wc_smoke_test_al.json | AL           | Alabama        | TestData/ExternalDataOverrides.json |\r\n\t| AR        | TestData/Scenarios/Smoke/016_wc_smoke_test_ar.json | AR           | Arkansas       | TestData/ExternalDataOverrides.json |\r\n\t| AZ        | TestData/Scenarios/Smoke/016_wc_smoke_test_az.json | AZ           | Arizona        | TestData/ExternalDataOverrides.json |\r\n\t| CT        | TestData/Scenar